check、make verify-spec、275 项前端单测、make build 已通过；新完整 Python 与完整原生套件正在运行，该提交 CI 尚未完成。前一提交 be70e0c 全 Python 为 1195 PASS / 2 FAIL，CI 也复现旧路由计数和取消导入测试的过期假设；本提交仅修这两项测试，保留业务约束与原失败记录。固定提交证据将随进度提交另行发布。\n- 开发证据：47 项推荐规则/持久化/游标测试、来源与 HTTP 16 项回归，以及 4 项实际浏览器场景通过；这些不是固定提交整套验收。开发失败、修复与独立静态审查原件已保留，本地整理中的证据包尚未随本源码提交发布。\n- 视觉：开发版 1440/390 共 7 张真实截图已双人查看。浏览器/API 真正重启、四条精确父链导航、真实 412、当前独立测试隐藏迟到来源、受控归档前置后禁开旧推荐分别有实际场景。受控第二父链与归档前置不代表已实现用户发布/归档 HTTP 工作流。\n- 公开内容：120 个明确列出的源码/契约文件已检查暂存 diff、路径与凭据模式，测试使用原创合成数据；运行库、凭据和个人教材未纳入提交。\n- 未运行与下一步：完成固定提交全 Python、全原生及 CI 后发布可回读证据，才申请 review；后续 M5.1。真实 Provider、Codex 和学习效果均为 NOT_RUN。未获人工审查批准不自动合并或关闭 Issue。\n","created_at":"2026-09-15T03:21:43Z","updated_at":"2026-09-15T03:31:30Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"bb70763b12f9ab7cc57466445f240a1ba40f1462","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":true,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kl3574/Learning_Workbench/pulls/48/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kl3574/Learning_Workbench/pulls/48/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kl3574/Learning_Workbench/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kl3574/Learning_Workbench/issues/48/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kl3574/Learning_Workbench/statuses/4cf13f7ed2456d0c7d62a49513055db8b2c8fb20","head":{"label":"kl3574:feat/M4.2-recommendations","ref":"feat/M4.2-recommendations","sha":"4cf13f7ed2456d0c7d62a49513055db8b2c8fb20","user":{"login":"kl3574","id":31810429,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxODEwNDI5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/31810429?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kl3574","html_url":"https://github.com/kl3574","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kl3574/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kl3574/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kl3574/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"ht